    "name": {
      "value": "Major Bagpipes Of Turmoil"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "While those who appreciate bagpipes may like the sound of this gray reed and black leather instrument, its real purpose is to sow turmoil against a performer's enemies, spreading discord with each note. While playing the bagpipes, you gain a +1 item bonus to Performance checks and to Intimidation checks made to Demoralize.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list.\n\nThe item bonuses are +2.\n\n- - **4th:** confusion, painful vibrations\n- - **5th:** banishment, crushing despair, synaptic pulse"
    },
