                  "description": {
                    "value": "You send powerful sound waves through an opponent's body, vibrating its bones and internal organs painfully.\n\nThe creature takes 8d6 sonic damage and must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The target takes full damage, is sickened 1, and is deafened for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target takes double damage, is sickened 2, and is deafened for 1 minute."
                  },
